's JobScope::Org(_) => store.set_atom_embeddings(..) called the unscoped Store method where the Consumer arm called set_atom_embeddings_scoped. It now opens begin_tenant_system_scoped_without_account and takes the same Ok-commit/Err-rollback shape the Consumer arm uses. Slice 4 also rewrote JobScope's own doc comment in this file, which still described the Org arm as ambient by design and named the conversion as future work. No JobScope::Org arm in this file runs a statement on the bare pool now. The owner exemption asserted at pool build by worker_pool_rls_exemption_breach is a second line rather than the only cover; at OPS-4-T the pool refuses to build and embedding stops with a logged error for that tenant.
