e.rs scopes its own writes (see its entry above), so that is not a gap. No JobScope::Org arm in this file runs a statement on the bare pool now. The owner exemption asserted at pool build by tenancy::registry::worker_pool_rls_exemption_breach is a second line rather than the only cover -- at OPS-4-T the pool refuses to build and summarisation stops loudly.
